 "text": "Hi! How's everything going? And you only have the tent stakes with you, no tools to pull them out, and no rope to hook them around your bag. Make several rings of sticks, one right under the tent pole, and pull the stake out with it. Use the ring to hook it around your bag. The tent will hold the stake in place until you pitch the peg the other side. Once the tent is up, use the peg for the ring as planned. Let them help with the next pitch. A useful method will save you every time. Try it at the break and it' pay back for the first.",
